{"id":"eco-quechang","cat":"economy","type":"贸易","name":"榷场","era":"两宋","year":1005,"endYear":null,"ptype":null,"birth":null,"death":null,"summary":"宋与辽、金、西夏在边境设榷场，进行官方监管的互市贸易。","tags":["辽","西夏","金","边境贸易"],"groups":[],"minor":false,"detail":"宋输出茶、绢、瓷器、书籍，输入马匹、皮毛、药材。榷场既是经济交流，也是外交筹码。","body":null,"refs":null,"categoryName":"经济","createdAt":"2026-11-06 09:09:35","updatedAt":"2026-11-06 09:09:35","related":[{"id":"eco-liao-quechang","name":"辽宋榷场贸易","cat":"economy"},{"id":"pol-waijiao","name":"和议与岁币","cat":"politics"},{"id":"tl-1005","name":"澶渊之盟","cat":"timeline"}],"sources":[{"source":"wikipedia","lang":"zh","title":"榷場","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%A6%B7%E5%A0%B4","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","revision_id":80550147,"qid":"Q19855929","confidence":0.84,"extract":"榷场，是宋、辽、金、元各朝代，于边境设立的互市市场，各民族可以在此互通有无。明代也在西北边境一些地方设立榷场，由官方管理，进行茶叶与马匹的贸易。","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T14:38:19"}]}